              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyomitan tapan kïnomnyö nyo pö puser pö lalwatïn nko tapanpa chelölos nko nyo pö piköchan pipö Yaudi nko nyo pö pipö punton. Kyosïkan tapan kanastin nko wölo le surkwen nko wölo le nanam, anyorunö tapan kongot cho le putï! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyopöghisyan awongwï kïnyïl cho chang. Kyowestan akimonyorwanye rïwön kïnyïl cho chang. Kyamanïn kömöy nko maral, akïruran kïnyïl cho chang, ampur wölo kaghït amotïng sïra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amelö ki ngalechoni pö sany opïn, kyasïngan ighisyewut pö kanisen löwïr kïtenö osis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato nyarkalal chitö anka, ochan nyarkalal tïkwïl. Ato kïlelchï chitö anka, owongunan ante tïkwïl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
